# Generated by Cargo
# will have compiled files and executables
/target/
gen/
WixTools
resources

# The sidecar directory holds downloaded engines, which are reproducible — EXCEPT
# the alpha, which is vendored on purpose. MetaCubeX publishes the mihomo alpha as
# a single rolling prerelease and deletes the previous one, so its URL stops
# existing; on 2026-10-26 that made the client uncompilable because
# `tauri.conf.json` lists it in `externalBin`. See the root .gitignore and
# docs/reference/STILL-OPEN.md.
#
# Git cannot re-include a file inside an excluded DIRECTORY, so the directory is
# excluded by its contents (`sidecar/*`) rather than wholesale, and the one
# vendored file is negated. Every other sidecar stays ignored.
sidecar/*
!sidecar/verge-mihomo-alpha-x86_64-unknown-linux-gnu
